{"term": {"label": "仁", "variants": []}, "source": {"id": "4A", "url": "https://ctext.org/mengzi/li-lou-i", "title": "離婁上", "description": "孟子曰：「離婁之明，公輸子之巧，不以規矩，不能成方員：師曠之聰，不以六律，不能正五音；堯舜之道，不以仁政，不能平治天下。今有仁心仁聞而民不被其澤，不可法於後世者，不行先王之道也。\n「故曰，徒善不足以為政，徒法不能以自行。《詩》云：『不愆不忘，率由舊章。』遵先王之法而過者，未之有也。聖人既竭目力焉，繼之以規矩準繩，以為方", "occurrences": 30, "data": null}, "network": {"directed": false, "multigraph": false, "graph": {}, "nodes": [{"form": "下", "id": "下"}, {"form": "仁", "id": "仁"}, {"form": "今", "id": "今"}, {"form": "位", "id": "位"}, {"form": "侯", "id": "侯"}, {"form": "君", "id": "君"}, {"form": "在", "id": "在"}, {"form": "安", "id": "安"}, {"form": "惡", "id": "惡"}, {"form": "政", "id": "政"}, {"form": "樂", "id": "樂"}, {"form": "死", "id": "死"}, {"form": "水", "id": "水"}, {"form": "治", "id": "治"}, {"form": "言", "id": "言"}, {"form": "高", "id": "高"}], "edges": [{"weight": 2.0408267055520564, "source": "水", "target": "下"}, {"weight": 2.2792377289970545, "source": "水", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 0.7286403165858877, "source": "下", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 0.9422144168839467, "source": "下", "target": "政"}, {"weight": 0.6545323444321658, "source": "下", "target": "治"}, {"weight": 1.1935288451648527, "source": "下", "target": "今"}, {"weight": 0.9422144168839467, "source": "下", "target": "位"}, {"weight": 1.180625440328945, "source": "樂", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 2.4928118292951136, "source": "樂", "target": "今"}, {"weight": 3.0524276172305362, "source": "樂", "target": "惡"}, {"weight": 3.340109689682317, "source": "樂", "target": "死"}, {"weight": 0.7751603322207804, "source": "仁", "target": "政"}, {"weight": 0.892943367877164, "source": "仁", "target": "治"}, {"weight": 1.7196219410616318, "source": "仁", "target": "今"}, {"weight": 1.87377262088889, "source": "仁", "target": "位"}, {"weight": 0.7751603322207804, "source": "仁", "target": "在"}, {"weight": 1.87377262088889, "source": "仁", "target": "高"}, {"weight": 0.892943367877164, "source": "仁", "target": "侯"}, {"weight": 0.892943367877164, "source": "仁", "target